OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGovernment failures allowed Covid to
OL,4,A'spread like wildfire' in care homes,
OL,5,Ainquiry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government at the time knew the
OL,8,Fcare sector was "extremely vulnerable"
OL,9,Fto a pandemic but still failed to act
OL,10,Funtil it was too late, a campaigner for
OL,11,Fthe families says
OL,13,FCurrent Health Secretary Yvette Cooper
OL,14,Fsays the government will respond to the
OL,15,Freport's recommendations and says adult
OL,16,Fsocial care has "for too long been
OL,17,Fundervalued"
OL,19,FThere were more than 43,000 deaths
OL,20,Finvolving Covid in care homes between
OL,21,FMarch 2020 and July 2022
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
