OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says outage affecting
OL,4,Abanks and court video links caused by
OL,5,A'power event'
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle says an outage in its Cloud
OL,8,Fservice - which has caused problems for
OL,9,Fcourts, banks, and other businesses
OL,10,Fonline - was caused by a "power event"
OL,12,FOnline bank Revolut, Halifax bank, and
OL,13,Fdelivery service DPD were among the
OL,14,Fbusinesses reporting issues
OL,16,FElsewhere, the courts service said its
OL,17,Fvideo links were affected - the
OL,18,FCriminal Bar Association said
OL,19,Fprosecution and defence barristers in
OL,20,FEngland and Wales could not "proceed
OL,21,Fwith trials and other hearings"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
